# EXAMPLE ONLY — do not activate without Architect review, a real domain,
# verified DNS/firewall/TLS, and confirmation that this proxy runs on the HOST.
# If the proxy runs inside a container, 127.0.0.1 means that container,
# NOT the CachyOS host; use an intentionally configured container network.
#
# This public route must NEVER proxy the local Python portal-app, Sanctum,
# Tailscale admin interface, Immich, Jellyfin, Kavita, Navidrome, SearXNG,
# VOS, agent tools, SQLite, Podman sockets, or internal administration.
portal.example.com {
    encode zstd gzip
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8088
}
